@startuml Admin Manage Messages - Sequence Diagram

actor Admin
participant "MessageController" as MsgCtrl
participant "ContactMessage" as Message
participant "MessageReply" as Reply
participant "View" as View

== View Messages ==
Admin -> MsgCtrl: index()
MsgCtrl -> Message: orderBy(created_at, desc)->get()
Message --> MsgCtrl: messages
MsgCtrl -> View: show admin.messages.index(messages)
View --> Admin: display messages list

== View Message Details ==
Admin -> MsgCtrl: show(message)
MsgCtrl -> Message: find(id)
Message --> MsgCtrl: message
MsgCtrl -> Message: markAsRead()
Message --> MsgCtrl: marked_read
MsgCtrl -> Reply: where(contact_message_id)->get()
Reply --> MsgCtrl: replies
MsgCtrl -> View: show admin.messages.show(message, replies)
View --> Admin: display message details

== Reply to Message ==
Admin -> MsgCtrl: reply(request, message)
MsgCtrl -> MsgCtrl: validate(request)
MsgCtrl -> Reply: create()
Reply --> MsgCtrl: reply_created
MsgCtrl -> View: redirect with success
View --> Admin: show "Reply sent successfully"

@enduml
